# PROGRAM 5 pando: the Pando response layer
#
# Hand written Brainfuck in the house style of text dot bf: comments never
# hold a command character; @cell checkpoints and tilde run lengths are
# checked by tools/bftool/lint
#
# Port of PandoAdSignals isSponsoredTree; the flag probing of PandoTrees
# readJson and PandoResponseHooks filterResult from 1 2 1: the host
# serializes trees; caches verdicts per tree and rebuilds lists while the
# decisions are made here
#
# OP 54 PANDO VERDICT: handle u32; class facts; cached verdict; flag memo;
# each 0 when the caller does not know it and verdict 3 means looked up and
# not cached; answers sponsored
# OP 53 PANDO FILTER: handle u32; declared Object or unknown; declared
# interface; declared accepts ArrayList; declared type handle u32; answers
# action; result handle u32; removed u32
#
# Limits: JSON of at most 524288 chars per tree and 65536 per item; lists of
# at most 256 entries; four flag pairs
#
# Every if copies its subject into a temp flag t and runs the body once
# while the flag is set; an else keeps a second flag; numbers are little
# endian and compare from the high byte down
#
# Cells
#
